    {
      "noteVersion": 3,
      "content": "The error code for “(\\mathbf{x} = \\error)” used to be ( \\mathtt{OOB}, \\mathbf{e} ); now it becomes ( \\panic, \\registers_7, \\mathbf{e} ). So the code is different: if we can’t parse the data to export, we do a panic instead of an OOB code.",
      "date": 1738333764949,
      "author": "",
      "selectionStart": {
        "pageNumber": 52,
        "index": 757
      },
      "selectionEnd": {
        "pageNumber": 52,
