    {
      "noteVersion": 3,
      "content": "- Old call: \n $\\Psi_M(\\Lambda(\\delta[s], \\mathbf{c}_t, c), 0, g, a, F, (\\emptyset, []))$ \n\n- New call: \n $\\Psi_M(\\Lambda(\\delta[w_s], (p_\\mathbf{x})_t, w_c), 0, w_g, a, F, (\\emptyset, []))$ ",
